        // ---- Forza Horizon 5: catalog from ManteoMax's spreadsheet ----
        //
        // Keyed by Forza CarOrdinal (as a string, that's what SimHub's FH5
        // reader surfaces in StatusDataBase.CarId). Engine layout and
        // cylinder count are static-per-ordinal data, so they always match
        // what's authoritative for the *stock* engine. Engine swaps are
        // handled by the Forza UDP NumCylinders field which dynamically
        // tracks the active engine, telemetry overrides this bake on the
        // next frame whenever the user has swapped engines.
